ations":1,"id":"evt_55ddf86c9959f04eb5b28cb59a45eae2953dd8833eab0fc00702bb68a79ad96a","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-the-power-of-meta-access-in-the-software-of-the-fu-4-edac4f01e1/","observation_id":"obs_edac4f01e102df97edc3a99bedad0e47900118ca8eb5521c8a967fd32e30b8c0","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:22:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"The Power of Meta Access in the Software of the Future --- Demonstrated on LLM Chat UIs and Chat AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6946cf536ab340e76842588cd231fa56c3c087cc3499c2db340bd1952f46e8f6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-a-framework-for-context-enrichment-and-selective-r-0-1ba2bc1e63/","observation_id":"obs_1ba2bc1e6399e93d4fd435a7c22726067a41e0e5dc538d05675de7d9f0122609","published_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何通过有控制地补充提示上下文，减少大语言模型智能体在语义不变改写下行为的波动，同时保持对社会环境变化的合理响应。作者提出“上下文增强”和“选择性稳健性”框架，并在囚徒困境类博弈中进行了验证。","title":"A Framework for Context Enrichment and Selective Robustness in LLM Social Agents"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":6,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":1.0,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:A